{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 7, :comments ["<b>And its fifth he adds to it.</b> If he admits on his own, he adds only one fifth. And if there are witnesses, he adds two fifths. And the Sages said: a fifth of the fifth, as I explained in the section of ויקרא." "<b>And he gives to the one to whom he is liable.</b> To teach you that if he owed his fellow a maneh, he came to court and did not manage to pay him before the creditor of the claimant came — they take from the hand of the defendant and give to the creditor of the claimant, as it is said: <b>and he gives to the one to whom he is liable</b> — in any case."], :book :numbers, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 5, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T15:16:32.864604681Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}